				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I get emails from old EQ friends, fellow clan members, watching "G4" Gamers Network on cable, I also read Maxim magazine and read up on the new games coming out.
<br />

<br />
Here is a place to talk about some of the games you all play.
<br />

<br />
A few games I try to  play are Call of Duty, Spellforce, EQ and WoW. 
<br />

<br />
Depending on time and all that.
<br />

<br />
Call of Duty is what they call an FPS (First Person Shooter), Spellforce is an RPG/RTS (Role Playing Game/Real Time Strategy)  
<br />

<br />
I also play Rome:Total War from time to time to take a break from the norm.
<br />

<br />
Guild Wars is very much like a MMORPG (Massively Multiplayer Online Role Playing Game) in a non-standard sense.  Excellent Graphics, easy to learn interface.
<br />

<br />
I haven't played it since E3, but it was pretty fun.
<br />

<br />
Post thoughts on games you all play.  It would be interesting to see everyones views on various games.<br />_________________<br /><img src="http://eq.clan-donald.com/images/badge.jpg" border="0" />
